# Force LF for tooling + skill sources on every platform. Windows CI checks out
# CRLF by default, which broke verify-skills.mjs's \n-anchored frontmatter/SQL
# regexes (0 blocks found, "malformed frontmatter"). Shell scripts also MUST be LF
# to run. Files are already stored LF, so this only affects checkout, not history.
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
